sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Operator
  participant C as Coordinator
  participant A as Active party
  participant P as Passive party (each)
  A->>C: Register(role=active) over mTLS
  P->>C: Register(role=passive) over mTLS
  Note over C: gate binds claimed id + role to the certificate,<br/>one active only
  O->>C: start session (config validated against schema + manifests)
  C-->>A: START (via Heartbeat reply)
  C-->>P: START (via Heartbeat reply)
  P->>A: Align (experimental hashes or DH-PSI rounds)
  A-->>P: aligned order
  Note over A,P: same seed ⇒ same split and batch schedule at every party
  loop every epoch
    loop every mini-batch b
      Note over P: H = f(X_b)  (local forward)
      P->>A: Exchange(MsgHeader{session,epoch,batch,attempt,sender}, digest, H)
      Note over A: slot barrier: wait for all required H<br/>duplicate / retry → cached reply, no 2nd step
      Note over A: L = ℓ(g(H_A, H_1..H_N), Y_b)<br/>optimizer step
      A-->>P: ∂L/∂H
      Note over P: backward + optimizer step
    end
    Note over A,P: validation metrics (active), checkpoints (all)
    A->>C: Barrier(epoch) + Report(metrics)
    P->>C: Barrier(epoch) + Report(telemetry)
    C-->>A: release next epoch
    C-->>P: release next epoch
  end
  A->>C: test metrics, run summary
  C->>O: session summary, runs/<session>/
